[{"id":6,"name":"Learning.infinite_setOf_eq_of_tendsto_div","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.LeanMachineLearning.PullCount","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"16904dbe4f1e2cf5","local":"3cbfaadaa69586cb","content":"cb24f0271862eea8"},"doc":"If arm `k` has a *positive* limiting proportion `N_{n,k}/n → v > 0`, it is chosen infinitely\noften: `N_{n,k} = (N_{n,k}/n)·n → ∞`, so `infinite_setOf_eq_of_pullCount_atTop` applies. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"DecidableEq","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"DecidableEq 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,11,"DecidableEq"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"𝓐","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"ω","role":"variable","type":"Ω","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"head":"Real","implicit":true,"name":"v","role":"variable","type":"ℝ","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Real"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"LT.lt","implicit":false,"name":"hv","role":"hypothesis","type":"0 < v","typeRefs":[[2,3,"LT.lt"]]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Filter.Tendsto","implicit":false,"name":"hN","role":"hypothesis","type":"Filter.Tendsto (fun n => ↑(pullCount A k n ω) / ↑n) Filter.atTop (nhds v)","typeRefs":[[0,14,"Filter.Tendsto"],[27,36,"Learning.pullCount"],[46,47,"HDiv.hDiv"],[52,64,"Filter.atTop"],[66,70,"nhds"]]}],"conclusion":"{j | A j ω = k}.Infinite","conclusionHead":"Set.Infinite","conclusionRefs":[[3,4,"Set.ofPred"],[11,12,"Eq"],[16,24,"Set.Infinite"]],"decl":"Learning.infinite_setOf_eq_of_tendsto_div"},"code":"/-- If arm `k` has a *positive* limiting proportion `N_{n,k}/n → v > 0`, it is chosen infinitely\noften: `N_{n,k} = (N_{n,k}/n)·n → ∞`, so `infinite_setOf_eq_of_pullCount_atTop` applies. -/\nlemma infinite_setOf_eq_of_tendsto_div {k : 𝓐} {ω : Ω} {v : ℝ} (hv : 0 < v)\n    (hN : Tendsto (fun n ↦ (pullCount A k n ω : ℝ) / (n : ℝ)) atTop (𝓝 v)) :\n    {j | A j ω = k}.Infinite","proof":":= by\n  refine infinite_setOf_eq_of_pullCount_atTop ?_\n  refine (hN.pos_mul_atTop hv (tendsto_natCast_atTop_atTop (R := ℝ))).congr' ?_\n  filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop 1] with n hn\n  have hne : (n : ℝ) ≠ 0 := Nat.cast_ne_zero.mpr (by omega)\n  rw [div_mul_cancel₀ _ hne]","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/LeanMachineLearning/PullCount.lean","start":55,"end":64,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/LeanMachineLearning/PullCount.lean#L55-L64"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["DecidableEq","lean4","definition"],["DivInvMonoid.toDiv","mathlib","instance"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Filter.Tendsto","mathlib","definition"],["Filter.atTop","mathlib","definition"],["HDiv.hDiv","lean4","definition"],["LT.lt","lean4","definition"],["Learning.pullCount","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.cast","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["OfNat.ofNat","lean4","definition"],["PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instDivInvMonoid","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instLT","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instZero","mathlib","instance"],["Real.pseudoMetricSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Set.Infinite","mathlib","definition"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"],["UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","mathlib","instance"],["Zero.toOfNat0","lean4","instance"],["instHDiv","lean4","instance"],["nhds","mathlib","definition"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"directExternal":["DecidableEq","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Eq","Filter.Tendsto","Filter.atTop","HDiv.hDiv","LT.lt","Learning.pullCount","Nat","Nat.cast","Nat.instPreorder","OfNat.ofNat","PseudoMetricSpace.toUniformSpace","Real","Real.instDivInvMonoid","Real.instLT","Real.instNatCast","Real.instZero","Real.pseudoMetricSpace","Set.Infinite","Set.ofPred","UniformSpace.toTopologicalSpace","Zero.toOfNat0","instHDiv","nhds"],"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"626a0ba966ded368c52c5fcad1f75afbe62507b6","date":"2026-09-01"}},{"id":7,"name":"Learning.infinite_setOf_eq_of_pullCount_atTop","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"AlphaRAR.LeanMachineLearning.PullCount","package":"AlphaRAR","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"fae1e9d928874f9b","local":"2fef82372891af19","content":"96168ef3b73e9f04"},"doc":"If arm `k`'s pull count diverges along a path, the arm is chosen infinitely often. (Were the\nhit set finite, the count would be bounded by its cardinality.) ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"Ω","role":"type","type":"Type u_1","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"ℕ → Ω → 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,1,"Nat"]]},{"explicit":false,"head":"DecidableEq","implicit":false,"name":"","role":"instance","type":"DecidableEq 𝓐","typeRefs":[[0,11,"DecidableEq"]]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"k","role":"variable","type":"𝓐","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":false,"implicit":true,"name":"ω","role":"variable","type":"Ω","typeRefs":[]},{"explicit":true,"head":"Filter.Tendsto","implicit":false,"name":"hN","role":"hypothesis","type":"Filter.Tendsto (fun n => ↑(pullCount A k n ω)) Filter.atTop Filter.atTop","typeRefs":[[0,14,"Filter.Tendsto"],[27,36,"Learning.pullCount"],[47,59,"Filter.atTop"],[60,72,"Filter.atTop"]]}],"conclusion":"{j | A j ω = k}.Infinite","conclusionHead":"Set.Infinite","conclusionRefs":[[3,4,"Set.ofPred"],[11,12,"Eq"],[16,24,"Set.Infinite"]],"decl":"Learning.infinite_setOf_eq_of_pullCount_atTop"},"code":"/-- If arm `k`'s pull count diverges along a path, the arm is chosen infinitely often. (Were the\nhit set finite, the count would be bounded by its cardinality.) -/\nlemma infinite_setOf_eq_of_pullCount_atTop {k : 𝓐} {ω : Ω}\n    (hN : Tendsto (fun n ↦ (pullCount A k n ω : ℝ)) atTop atTop) :\n    {j | A j ω = k}.Infinite","proof":":= by\n  intro hfin\n  have hbound : ∀ n, (pullCount A k n ω : ℝ) ≤ (hfin.toFinset.card : ℝ) := by\n    intro n\n    have hle : pullCount A k n ω ≤ hfin.toFinset.card := by\n      rw [pullCount]\n      refine Finset.card_le_card fun s hs ↦ ?_\n      rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hs\n      exact hfin.mem_toFinset.mpr hs.2\n    exact_mod_cast hle\n  obtain ⟨n, hn⟩ := (hN.eventually_gt_atTop (hfin.toFinset.card : ℝ)).exists\n  exact absurd (hbound n) (not_le.mpr hn)","source":{"path":"AlphaRAR/LeanMachineLearning/PullCount.lean","start":38,"end":53,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/alpha-rar/blob/e7164a80baea3f4f65e108de31d2d561dd35e350/AlphaRAR/LeanMachineLearning/PullCount.lean#L38-L53"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["DecidableEq","lean4","definition"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["Filter.Tendsto","mathlib","definition"],["Filter.atTop","mathlib","definition"],["Learning.pullCount","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Nat.cast","lean4","definition"],["Nat.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instNatCast","mathlib","instance"],["Real.instPreorder","mathlib","instance"],["Set.Infinite","mathlib","definition"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"directExternal":["DecidableEq","Eq","Filter.Tendsto","Filter.atTop","Learning.pullCount","Nat","Nat.cast","Nat.instPreorder","Real","Real.instNatCast","Real.instPreorder","Set.Infinite","Set.ofPred"],"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"626a0ba966ded368c52c5fcad1f75afbe62507b6","date":"2026-09-01"}}]